  "task": "There is RNA-seq 10X Cell Ranger data and BCR-seq data from 6 patients. You can find metadata related to the patients in the metadata.csv file. For each patient, two measurements was taken: one before influenza vaccination (e.g. 09-0) and the other 7 days after the vaccination (e.g. 09-7). Load the data, perform preprocessing and quality control. Keep only cells with single BCR chain pair. Keep only cells for which both BCR and RNA-seq data exist. Output the remaining number of cells after filtering. Define clonotypes. Find the total number of identified clonotypes. Find the size of the largest clonotype."
